        "updated": "2026-08-28T09:00:00Z",
        "content": "Public traffic hits Pingap, which routes to the Go gateway. Inference runs on vLLM on p4d nodes (EKS demogpu-eu1). Postgres is the system of record; Redis caches sessions. Weights sync nightly from Hugging Face."
